Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Every NBA free throw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.09,0:00:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,is shot from 15
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,feet… except it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.49,0:00:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the rulebook
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,measures that line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.27,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,from the backboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,not from the rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The rim sits 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,inches off the glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's 18 inches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,wide, so the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,of the hoop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,is 15 inches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,backboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means every free
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,throw is really 13
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,feet, 9 inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But here's the weird
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The three-point line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,IS measured from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the middle of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So the two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,most important lines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.07,0:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,in basketball are measured
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,from two different places.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And some of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the biggest guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:24.100,Default,,0,0,0,,in the league still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.100,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,can't make it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,from 13 feet 9.
